{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3f3375fade1a8fa1","name":"Proton Grenades","source":{"id":"source:reference-3f3375fade1a8fa1","title":"Proton Grenades","revision":20024,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:03:11Z","sha256":"3dfbc89f1e509daeb2de034cc9fb976d285ecd7b6a9ab1713cf771bdb05ce7fa","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20024","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Proton%20Grenades&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3f3375fade1a8fa1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 8d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Proton Grenades throw out a high-energy burst of accelerated particles capable of disassembling matter at a molecular level. A Proton Grenade detonates on impact. When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with a Proton Grenade, make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target in the Grenade's 3-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. Targets you hit take full damage, and targets you miss take half damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
